{"id":"n74183-2-7","stage":1,"title":"생활 · 生活","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74183-2-7-1","ko":"민준 씨, 이번에 더 좋은 회사로 옮겼다면서요?","zh":"敏俊，我听说你这次换到一家更好的公司了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊。","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}},{"text":"씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"회사로","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사로","audio":"/audio/d40e365434e517d3a722.mp3"}},{"text":"옮겼다면서요?","meaning":"搬，换，调，迁移","explanation":"옮기다：搬，换，调，迁移；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"10","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮겼다면서요","audio":"/audio/e295c4720a63ec2d49c2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，换，调，迁移","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"将原来的住所、所属等换成别的。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/58fa73720785081e335b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74183-2-7-2","ko":"네. 그래서 생활이 좀 나아졌어요.","zh":"对。所以生活状况好了一些。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"생활이","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"2","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활이","audio":"/audio/6658e900c13f7d60c43e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"나아졌어요.","meaning":"好转，提高","explanation":"나아지다：好转，提高；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나아지다","audio":"/audio/13128960a6e72aa9e9a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16308","senseId":"1","lemma":"나아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나아졌어요","audio":"/audio/6935f1799b6bdccd8dc3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"谋生并维持生计。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"13128960a6e72aa9","term":"나아지다","zh":"好转，提高","audio":"/audio/13128960a6e72aa9e9a1.mp3","entryId":"16308","definition":"情况或状态更加好起来。","pronunciation":["나아지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fce64b60c1b21e1a0aa0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.315,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74183","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5789,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["敏俊，我听说你这次换到一家更好的公司了？","对。所以生活状况好了一些。","我的意思是，让你把分内的事好好做好。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊，我听说你这次换到一家更好的公司了？","对。所以生活状况好了一些。","我的意思是，让你把分内的事好好做好。"],"answer":1}]}
